  m_text: 'This is one of the paintings in The Weeping Woman series of oil paintings
    created by Pablo Picasso in 1937. It depicts a woman crying in an abstract cubism
    style that Picasso was known for, and was painted for anti-war imagery after
    the bombing of Guernica in the Spanish Civil War. '
